# SHA-256 of the Holochain binaries this build downloads, as GitHub reports
# each release asset's digest. A tag with "-flowsta." is a release of
# https://github.com/WeAreFlowsta/holochain-build (the official source with
# the patches listed there); any other tag is a release of
# https://github.com/holochain/holochain. The build stops when a download does not match: a
# replaced or tampered release asset never reaches an installer.
